Subject: [PATCH 81/97] recoverssm, tests: kernel-level test of the PP-deferred
 commit

Runs the real Triton verify and commit kernels (CUDA, or CPU under TRITON_INTERPRET=1): verify A, verify B, then
commit A deferred. Committed states and conv windows equal the PP=1 order bit for bit, in none and align mode.
---
